    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d225">

                <pb facs="0737" n="725" sameAs="frus:frus1946v04/pg725"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">C.P.(Gen)Doc.1.O.11.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article 22, paragraph 2</hi></head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-outside-research" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1946-10-15T23:59:59+01:00" notBefore="1946-07-29T00:00:00+01:00"
                        >undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Delete the words: “at present in Hungary” and replace them by the
                        following text: “belonging before the 1st of September, 1939 to the United
                        Nations or their nationals and seized after this date by Hungary or which
                        …”</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>After the words: “secured possession” add a new sentence warded as
                        follows: “In case the return of property cannot be effected within six
                        months from the date of entry into force of the present Treaty, Hungary
                        undertakes to pay the United Nation concerned, in compensation, an amount
                        equal to the value of such property at the time of seizure and covering, if
                        need be, the depreciation due to its use by Hungary from the time of seizure
                        until the day of entry into force of the present Treaty.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
